# lookout's own state: the workspace and backlog of anything it is run against
# here, plus what it does to itself (incidents with no project in scope, the
# heals, the reverted self-heal attempts, the lock). Per-checkout, not the
# repo's, and self-heal refuses to run without this line, because a failed gate
# reverts with `git clean`. lookout.config.ts is deliberately not in here: it
# lives at the root, in git.
